.*
.* DSPOVR: the file overrides in effect for the job, merged over its
.* call levels; F11 shows each one where it was issued.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LVLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 5'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=KWDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 60'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=LVL CLASS=LVLCL VALUE='*'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=FILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TYPE CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=LEVEL CLASS=LVLCL.
:VAR NAME=KWDS CLASS=KWDCL.
:VAR NAME=MERGED CLASS=LVLCL VALUE='1'.
:LISTDEF NAME=OVRS VARS='OPT FILE TYPE LEVEL KWDS'.
:COND NAME=MERGED EXPR='&MERGED. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=ALL EXPR='&MERGED. NE "1"'.
:KEYL NAME=OVKEYS HELP='KEYS/OVKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=MERGED.F11=All file overrides
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=ALL.F11=Merged file overrides
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOVR KEYL=OVKEYS HELP=DSPOVR ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display All Merged File Overrides
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI VAR=LVL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LVL'.Call level
.* Not shown: it sets the colon column.
:DATAI VAR=MERGED USAGE=OUTPUT DISPLAY=NO.Call level of overrides
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OVRS VIEWS=2 MAXHEAD=2.(No overrides in effect)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5' HELP='DSPOVR/OPTIONS'.5=Display override details
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8' HELP='DSPOVR/OPTIONS'.8=Display contributing file overrides
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='DSPOVR/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/FILE'.File
:LISTCOL VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=LEVEL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LEVEL'.Level
:LISTCOL VAR=KWDS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/KWDS'.Keyword Specifications
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT FILE TYPE KWDS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT FILE TYPE LEVEL KWDS'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOVRD KEYL=OVKEYS HELP=DSPOVR ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Override Details
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/FILE'.File
:DATAI VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/TYPE'.Type
:DATAI VAR=LEVEL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LEVEL'.Call level
:DATAI VAR=KWDS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/KWDS'.Keywords
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPOVR.Display Overrides - Help
:P.The overrides that open operations of this job would use now, one
line per file with the keywords that apply, merged over the call
levels. F11 lists every override where it was issued instead; option
5 shows one in full.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/OVKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F11=All file overrides
:PD.All file overrides.
:PT.F11=Merged file overrides
:PD.Merged file overrides.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LVL'.Call level
:P.The call level shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPOVR/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/FILE'.File
:P.The file, by name and library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/TYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LEVEL'.Level
:P.The level of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/KWDS'.Keyword Specifications
:P.The keyword Specifications of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPOVR/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display override details
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display override details
it.
:PT.8=Display contributing file overrides
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to display contributing file
overrides it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
